0..47 Comment "// A `rec` block whose members call each other."
48..50 Comment "//"
51..128 Comment "// A block of plain definitions names each member before any body is read, so"
129..176 Comment "// members may call each other in either order."
177..179 Comment "//"
180..258 Comment "// Each member claims descent on its call of the other, which only a `def rec`"
259..298 Comment "// may claim, so each claim is refused."
299..301 Comment "//"
302..374 Comment "// - see: `surface/def-rec-and-copatterns.gandr` — a `def rec`\'s claim"
376..420 Comment "/// Evenness and oddness, each by the other."
